{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のうちに更新出来なくて\nごめんなさい(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はあるMVの撮影を\nしてました〜♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋元先生の755にも\nちらっと私たちのMVの\n写メが載ってますっ(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"連日寒いところで撮影を\nしてるんだけどなかなか\n寒さに慣れない(´°ω°｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒いところにいるせいか、\nやたらと頭の中では\nクマムシさんのあったかいんだから〜\nが無限ループしています(`･v･´)ゞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/02/07/6617928/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雪だっ♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前撮影の時に今発売中の\nBUBKAがおいてあって\nそこに川本紗矢ちゃんの\nグラビアが載ってて\n一瞬真夏かと思った！！と\nメンバーに言われました(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまにね、こじまこちゃんにも\n似てるって言ってもらえて\nすごく嬉しいんです(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな私が似てるって\n言ってもらえるなんて\n大変申し訳ないですが...(´°ω°｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか一緒に撮影とか\n出来たらいいなぁ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にこっ☆"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/02/07/6617928/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーーーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/02/07/6617928/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すーーーーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/02/07/6617928/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かーーーーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin61